    "The new 31-program/71-row Java logger authority and prior235+alias4 selected platform captures do not close the whole M2 gate.",
    "Failed retry03 retained 3652 partial decoded records after ENOSPC while writing source-after; no terminal candidate.",
    "Failed retry04 retained zero completed rows after macOS lsof mixed-selection handling caused monitor interruption; no terminal candidate.",
    "The earlier prep03 handoff was mutated after a frozen announcement; preserved prep04 incident records this and prep05 is a fresh lineage."
